 {
  "key": "A paper cup and two coins.",
  "files": [
   "src/chapters/museum3d/systems/EchoRadioChatter.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "All right. I can stay on the line. You do not have to report anything.",
  "files": [
   "src/chapters/museum3d/systems/EchoRadioChatter.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "Before you go, can you hear me over the transformer hum?",
  "files": [
   "src/chapters/museum3d/systems/EchoRadioChatter.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "Both hands, please. The corner already came off once.",
  "files": [
   "src/chapters/museum3d/systems/EchoRadioChatter.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "Check the basin before you start the pump. Anything caught in the grate?",
  "files": [
   "src/chapters/museum3d/systems/EchoRadioChatter.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "Did anyone wait here this late?",
  "files": [
   "src/chapters/museum3d/systems/EchoRadioChatter.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "Do you want the receiver off for the walk back?",
  "files": [
   "src/chapters/museum3d/systems/EchoRadioChatter.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "Give me a minute of quiet.",
  "files": [
   "src/chapters/museum3d/systems/EchoRadioChatter.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "Give the lamp time. Old fluorescent tubes dislike being watched.",
  "files": [
   "src/chapters/museum3d/systems/EchoRadioChatter.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "How do you know?",
  "files": [
   "src/chapters/museum3d/systems/EchoRadioChatter.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "How does the receiver sound?",
  "files": [
   "src/chapters/museum3d/systems/EchoRadioChatter.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "I can hear you. The earpiece smells like a coat closet.",
  "files": [
   "src/chapters/museum3d/systems/EchoRadioChatter.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "I will leave the channel open. No need to answer.",
  "files": [
   "src/chapters/museum3d/systems/EchoRadioChatter.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "If the grate is clear, start it. Do not put your hand under the impeller.",
  "files": [
   "src/chapters/museum3d/systems/EchoRadioChatter.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "It is a borrowed receiver. If it gets worse, use the spare earpiece in the side pocket.",
  "files": [
   "src/chapters/museum3d/systems/EchoRadioChatter.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "It is heavier than it looks.",
  "files": [
   "src/chapters/museum3d/systems/EchoRadioChatter.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "It smells like a coat closet.",
  "files": [
   "src/chapters/museum3d/systems/EchoRadioChatter.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "Keep the ledger flat. The binding was repaired last winter.",
  "files": [
   "src/chapters/museum3d/systems/EchoRadioChatter.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "Keep the line open?",
  "files": [
   "src/chapters/museum3d/systems/EchoRadioChatter.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "Leave it on.",
  "files": [
   "src/chapters/museum3d/systems/EchoRadioChatter.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "Loud and clear. The left channel clicks.",
  "files": [
   "src/chapters/museum3d/systems/EchoRadioChatter.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "Night staff used whatever paper was in front of them. Do not erase it.",
  "files": [
   "src/chapters/museum3d/systems/EchoRadioChatter.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "No answer usually means it works. Tap the receiver once if it cuts out.",
  "files": [
   "src/chapters/museum3d/systems/EchoRadioChatter.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "Of course. The door lights will lead you back.",
  "files": [
   "src/chapters/museum3d/systems/EchoRadioChatter.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "Only wet leaves.",
  "files": [
   "src/chapters/museum3d/systems/EchoRadioChatter.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "Public works used thick paper. They expected the records to outlive the pipes.",
  "files": [
   "src/chapters/museum3d/systems/EchoRadioChatter.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "She asked the city twice. Procurement closed both requests.",
  "files": [
   "src/chapters/museum3d/systems/EchoRadioChatter.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "Someone wrote a grocery list in it.",
  "files": [
   "src/chapters/museum3d/systems/EchoRadioChatter.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "Someone wrote a grocery list in the margin.",
  "files": [
   "src/chapters/museum3d/systems/EchoRadioChatter.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "Stop when the canvas edges meet. The old handle can keep its dignity.",
  "files": [
   "src/chapters/museum3d/systems/EchoRadioChatter.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "Take out the cup. Leave the coins. Maintenance stopped arguing about those in 1987.",
  "files": [
   "src/chapters/museum3d/systems/EchoRadioChatter.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "That is where the museum stored it. I cleaned the part that touches your ear.",
  "files": [
   "src/chapters/museum3d/systems/EchoRadioChatter.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "The bench paint is still tacky.",
  "files": [
   "src/chapters/museum3d/systems/EchoRadioChatter.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "The curtain winch sticks in damp weather. Do not force it past the stop.",
  "files": [
   "src/chapters/museum3d/systems/EchoRadioChatter.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "The station lamp takes twenty seconds to warm. If it flickers once, leave it alone.",
  "files": [
   "src/chapters/museum3d/systems/EchoRadioChatter.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "The vendor could fix it.",
  "files": [
   "src/chapters/museum3d/systems/EchoRadioChatter.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "Then the filter can take it. Your gloves will smell like the fountain either way.",
  "files": [
   "src/chapters/museum3d/systems/EchoRadioChatter.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "Then use the other end. The city has been repainting that bench since before Mara crossed.",
  "files": [
   "src/chapters/museum3d/systems/EchoRadioChatter.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "Three repair tickets from the same stall. The last attendant underlined “do not force.”",
  "files": [
   "src/chapters/museum3d/systems/EchoRadioChatter.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "Two cleaners and a bakery driver, most nights. The car was often late; the schedule still mattered.",
  "files": [
   "src/chapters/museum3d/systems/EchoRadioChatter.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "What is in the grate?",
